#: scripts/addons_core/bl_pkg/bl_extension_ops.py:1930
msgid ""
"Warning! Before unlocking, ensure another instance of Blender is not running."
msgstr ""
"Varning! Kontrollera att ingen annan instans av Blender körs innan du låser "
"upp."

